window.products.push({"id":652008,"name":"Kopmath Ceramic Travel Coffee Mug with Lid, Double Wall Insulated Travel Mug, Splash Resistant, 11.16 oz Fit Coffee Maker, Dishwasher Microwave Safe, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lG0i1QKgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Coffee On the Go. Our upgraded lid has a silicone ring that's 2X's wider and thicker for extra grip. The splash-resistant lid keeps coffee from sloshing out of your mug when walking and driving. With handless design and tapered base, it fits perfectly in different car cup holders. You can enjoy the pure taste of hot coffee for your commute. Double Wall Insulated Design. There is an inner and outer ceramic layer with air in between to create the insulating effect. This can help keep your coffee or tea warm longer. You can also reheat it in the microwave. Two walls also mean it won't burn your hands when you're holding it. Ideal Design for Everyday Use. Are you still worried that your mug is always too high to fit under the coffee machine? kopmath 11.16oz/5.51” tall ceramic double wall travel mug making it the perfect size for daily usage and fits easily under coffee makers. Is Ideal for all your daily routine coffee, tea or any occasion drinks with your friends or family. Easy to Spin & Splash Resistant Lid. Each mug comes with a BPA-free lid to prevent spillage. You can spin the lid to control the size of opening to avoid coffee flooding out to burn your mouth. The lid stays shut until you spin it open. No more lids that open accidentally and splash coffee in your new car. Ceramic Keeps Coffee's Flavor. If you are a real coffee lover who enjoys the pure taste of coffee, Kopmath ceramic travel mug is a wiser choice than metal or plastic mugs. Besides, ceramic mugs are made of high-temperature clay and smooth finish. It's safe in microwave and easy to clean by hand or dishwasher. Design with Heart, Great Gift. kopmath ceramic coffee cup adopts a simple and attentive design. You will find that each cup has its own embellishment design, and the glaze is used at the mouth of the cup to make the mouth of the cup smoother. When you drink It will have a delicate touch like drinking coffee. A great gift for your parents, wife, husband, boss, and colleagues.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lG0i1QKgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kopmath","source_asin":"B0BCFRC6VB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-652008","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCFRC6VB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCFRC6VB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
