window.products.push({"id":652095,"name":"MyGift Contemporary Tabletop Wine Rack, Brass Metal Wire & Burnt Wood 6-Bottle Wine Holder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aqu6jMgHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Display your finest vino on any countertop, buffet table or bar area with this 6-bottle contemporary wine rack. Featuring a brass wire design with sturdy burnt wood finish, this rack carefully cradles up to six bottles in a unique U-shaped wire holder. Allowing bottles to be stored on their side helps keep wine touching the cork and helps keep wine fresher. With a modern appeal and sufficient storage space, this wine bottle holder is perfect for any home or restaurant setting. Approximate Dimensions: 12.25 W x 7.25 D x 11.5 H (in inches)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aqu6jMgHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MyGift","source_asin":"B07WSRX226","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-652095","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WSRX226","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WSRX226","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
