window.products.push({"id":652231,"name":"White Sage & Lavender Incense Bricks (2 x 9 Bricks Each) with Rainbow Exotic Burner by Aromafume - Salvia Apiana & Lavender Extracts. Deepens Relaxati","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RiAB4aNVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"White Sage & Lavender Incense bricks (2 x 9 Bricks each) are a beautiful combination of natural sage extracts and Therapeutic Grade Lavender essential oil to deepen relaxation, cleanse and resonate positive energy. This is an impactful combination that provides purification along with a calming effect that soothes the senses. This set comes with our custom Exotic Incense Brick Burner Useful to debunk negative energies from spaces outside and within, White Sage & Lavender Incense bricks will relax your mind as well as purify the home. When burned, it diffuses a deep, earthy, sweet and inspiring scent that is perfect for relaxation, grounding & protection HOW TO USE: Place this low-smoke, non-toxic brick on the copper plate of our custom exotic burner and lighting a tea light candle below it. There is a clean fragrance released as the incense does not burn, but is operated by heating and emits a very rich and deep aroma which can scent a room upto 400 square foot in size! Each incense brick has a burn time of 3.5 hours SUSTAINABILITY: We strive to deliver an experience that’s positive in every way. All of our ingredients are ethically sourced and our products are 100% vegan and cruelty free. We support sustainable agricultural and manufacturing practices, invest in recyclable packaging, and are consciously mindful of our actions. As a values-driven business, we’re committed to building an eco-conscious future for perfumery, and set an example, that will inspire brands to embrace sustainable practices HERITAGE: We’ve been working on the art of blending natural materials since 1907, and have travelled the world in search of effective aromatics to use in our blends. This history, coupled with a desire to introduce innovative ways to consume fragrances has over the last century led to the creation of fantastic recipes, which translate memories and emotions into experiences. We take care in crafting exceptional products, manufactured in small batches, that are compellingly precious yet personal","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RiAB4aNVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aromafume","source_asin":"B09CDDDMX9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-652231","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CDDDMX9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CDDDMX9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
