window.products.push({"id":652655,"name":"Window Blinds Blackout Roller Sun Shades for Patios Doors Windows Pull Down Room Darkening Waterproof Thermal Insulation Blinds Privacy Kitchens [Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41kDbYoVPyL._AC_.jpg","description":"💚【NO NEED TO WAIT ABOUT 1-2 MONTHS】Your custom window shades will ship about 3-5 days after order done. Delivery in 5-7 working days. 💚We will appreciate customer precise measures & careful orders, avoid return without any quality issues. And we've got every confidence in the quality of our products. 💚FHSBLINDS offers a 1-year warranty on all our products, during which we will repair/replace them free of charge. 💚Please contact us by Amazon message if you have any questions. 💚【PRODUCT DETAILS】:【Blind Size】: 18”W x 36”H,【Fabric Size】: 16.6”W x 36”H. Noted: The fabric width is 1.4” narrower than total width. Roller Blinds made of 100% blackout fabric coated with same color backing, feeling soft and smooth. And block light effectively and keeping prying eyes out. Great for bedrooms, kitchen, living room, office, bathroom, den, nursery, garage, home theater, French door etc. 💚Close your window coverings at night to keep people from peering into your home. 💚【CLASSIC & SAFETY DESIGN】: Roller shade blind features a crisp & modern look equipped with metal tube and aluminum bottom rod. Smoothly and silently rolled up with its bead chain. We provide a special protection for children, roller window shades are equipped with a chain connector. When your child or pet is entangled in the chain, it will be disconnected by a certain pulling force to prevent the child from being injured. 💚Besides, We come with a safety device to attach the chain to the wall. 💚【High QUALITY AND AFFORDABLE】: 【Aluminum Bottom Rod】 Substitute aluminum for plastic, plumbs the fabric more, prevents from wind blowing. 【38mm Roll White Coating Tube】 Use 38mm tube instead of 28mm, Roller blinds provide strong support to the fabric so that the bottom of the fabric is on the same horizontal line and does not tilt.Our roller blinds are not only a functional product, but also a home decoration product. Novel style and trend, it can make your home environment more eye-catching. 💚【EASY TO INSTALL AND MAINTAIN】: Our corded roller blind are available in custom sizes. The shade size can be selected directly according to the width of the window frame during installation. Our window roller shade comes with an accessory kit including metal bracket, screws and install instruction for convenience. Clean with slightly damp cloth. 💚The new item may have subtle wrinkles, but it will disappear in several days, or using low-temperature ironing would be better.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41kDbYoVPyL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"fhsblinds","source_asin":"B0BVRPNH4R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-652655","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVRPNH4R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVRPNH4R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
