window.products.push({"id":652719,"name":"Premium Quality Stainless Steel Manual Coffee Grinder - Portable Burr Coffee Grinder - Conical Ceramic Burr for Precision Brewing - Silicone Lid to Ke","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y3MCQlUYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGH QUALITY MATERIALS: Our products are built to last! The coffee grinder manual stainless steel body, handle and knob are made with the highest quality materials - plus it has a durable ceramic burr. It also features a silicone grip for better handling and storing as one piece - never worry about losing the handle again. USE IT ANYWHERE: This portable manual coffee grinder is meant for you to take on the go! You can use it at home or carry it with you so you can rest assured you always have a delicious cup of fresh coffee wherever you go, be it hiking, camping, backpacking or out on the open road. It comes with a velvet bag to keep it safe and protected while you travel. ADJUSTABLE GRIND SELECTOR: The conical burr coffee grinder features better handling than your average coffee grinder. It features a built-in adjustable grind selector so you can fine-tune it to get the coarseness you want. Just turn the knob clockwise or counterclockwise so you can reach the perfect size for your coffee drink. MEASURED BREWS: The ceramic coffee grinder has a measuring base and container that ensures you get exactly the right brew every time. You don’t even need a scoop! Plus, it has a silicone lid to keep your ground coffee fresh inside the container. CUSTOMER SATISFACTION GUARANTEED: We are so sure that you’ll love our precision burr grinder that we offer a 100% customer guarantee. If you find anything you’re unsatisfied with, just contact us within 30 days of purchase and we will give you a 100% refund for the product - no questions asked! We do everything we can to make sure we keep our customers happy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y3MCQlUYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shanik","source_asin":"B07TYFN7KS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-652719","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TYFN7KS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TYFN7KS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
