window.products.push({"id":652721,"name":"Air Purifiers For Home Large Room, Ganiza 1570ft² 23db Less Noise Air Purifiers for Pets Remove 99.97% Pet Hair Dander Pollen Smoke Dust, Air Quality ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w3FM1hqjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【 Air Purifiers For Home Large Room 】 High CADR (350 m³/h / 206 CFM) and larger HEPA filter (10.6*7.8*7.8 in) , air purifiers deliver 360°uniform speed airflow to create fresher air. Air purifiers for pets clean up to 1570ft² in 60 minutes, 394ft² in 12 mins. The air cleaner is great choice for large room, office, bedroom, living room, basement and apartment. You can buy the official filters by searching \"B0B63G5RBG\". 【 Real-time Air Quality Monitor 】 No need to interrupt what you are doing and constantly adjust the fan speed. Air purifiers for home track the air quality and auto-adjust power in Auto Mode, displays the results you can see! It's what other large air purifiers lack, and one of the Ganiza's specialties. Real-time air quality display give you clarity and confidence in the air your family breathes. 【 23dB Less Noise Sleep 】 On sleep mode, air purifiers for bedroom work with 23db less noise and turn off all lights for a night of comfortable sleep. The silent air purifier makes you even forget its existence. BPA free (free of industrial chemicals) baby air purifier for nursery ensures your little one sleep safe and sound. 【 Efficient Purification 】 Alle*gies, including hay fever effect 40 million to 60 million Americans; wildfires across the West emitted more than a million tons of the particles. Thanks to the H13 true HEPA filter, air purifier for smoke removes 99.97% of PM2.5, VOC, smoke, cooking odors, dust, and particles 0.1 µm in size. Air purifiers for pets and alle*gies help you ease symptoms like sneezing, congestion, and difficulty breathing. 【 Fully Certified for Safer & Trusted 】 100% Ozone free, Energy Star (please contact us for the NO. of Energy Star to cut costs), CARB, CA PROP 65, Available for California. Instant 24/7 customer reply and lifetime support: Any questions please feel free to contact us, we'll help you at once until you're satisfied. 【 Multiple Filter Choice 】 Choose from a variety of replacement filters to best meet your needs. The Original Filter for multi-purpose coverage (Search for B0B63G5RBG). The Pet Allergy Filter helps to capture pet dander and absorb unpleasant odors (Search for B0BC972YRQ). And the Toxin Absorber Filter specializes in wildfire, smoke, smog, toxins, and VOCs (Search for B0BC982ZMJ). It's recommended to replace the air filter every 3-6 months to ensure the purification effect.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w3FM1hqjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ganiza","source_asin":"B0BDZQTV77","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-652721","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDZQTV77","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDZQTV77","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":652722,"name":"koziol DUNDEE Nailbrush, transparent green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71o1vfgBoTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100-Percent Made in Germany: Koziol has been creating fun award winning designs for the home since 1927 from their factory in Erbach Germany. 100-Percent Environmentally Aware: Less energy is needed to make Koziol products than items made of porcelain, ceramic or glass which results in generating the lowest CO2 emissions. The company's directive is to make desirable designs responsibly, which means they only use thermoplastics that are 100-Percent recyclable with non-toxic pigments and any waste created during manufacturing is always recycled. Koziol's award winning designs bring fun in to the home where people least expect it and at a very affordable price, so spread the word and make your house a Koziol home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71o1vfgBoTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Koziol","source_asin":"B001SX7DJ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-652722","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001SX7DJ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001SX7DJ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":652723,"name":"New York Map Matted Framed Art by Michael Tompsett in Black Frame, 16 by 20-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":57.04,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VqWufWUeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This matted framed art piece features a colorful map of the state of New York. Art and design were always Michael's favorite subjects at school. He was fortunate to land a job as a graphic designer at one of London's most prestigious publishing companies after leaving University. After 12 highly enjoyable years Michael Tompsett made the decision to pursue a full-time career creating his own work. The freedom and time to be able to focus solely on his own projects has been a wonderful experience. Although Michael likes to experiment with different styles and subjects, his main focus is on map art. He enjoys looking for unique and interesting ways to depict something which is very familiar. Maps are visual representations of the world we live in, a world which is incredibly diverse. Apart from maps, Michael Tompsett creates urban landmark and cityscape designs. 11x14 Size is an 8x10 giclee print under acrylic in a 11x14 black frame. 16x20 Size is an 11x14 giclee print under acrylic in a 16x20 black frame. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating museum quality fine art reproductions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VqWufWUeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00EQYS3GO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-652723","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EQYS3GO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EQYS3GO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
