window.products.push({"id":652742,"name":"SIMOE 12000BTU Mini Split Air Conditioner and Heater, 115V 20 SEER2 Ductless AC Unit with 1 Ton Heat Pump & Ductless Inverter System, Energy Efficient","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":579.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oF-62-QtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄️Super Power & Save Energy---- SIMOE mini split AC uses super power to cool or heat a 750 square foot room. Air conditioner unit has a dehumidification with 36points of efficient dehumidification per day. The pre-charged air conditioner uses a ductless mini split inverter system, 20 SEER2, with 1 Ton heat pump and inverter technology, which can save you up to 31% energy. ❄️Self-cleaning Function & Sleep Mode----- 4-step self-cleaning automatically cleans the inside of the mini split ac or heating system. (Deep condensation → frost → defrost rinse → 135℉ high temperature cleaning) In sleep mode, the split AC senses the ambient temperature and automatically lowers or raises to the optimal temperature. ❄️More Versatility---- Multiple functions of split AC heating system to meet more environmental needs. 5 functions: automatic, cooling, drying, heating, fan. 4 air speed settings: low/medium/high/auto. 4 intelligent modes: sleep mode, ECO (Economic) mode, i-feel (temperature sensing) mode, self-cleaning mode. ❄️Design of Enjoyment & Smart Sensor---- 0.5-24 hour timer and <42dB Super silent operation make you to enjoy a comfortable sleep. Mini Split AC comes with a remote control that allows you to control it from bed. In I-FEEL mode, the intelligent sensor on RC can sense your ambient temperature and adjust it to the most suitable temperature for you. ❄️Wide Angle air supply & 2 packages ----4D air flow(up-down left-right). Ductless air conditioner can adjust the air supply Angle to avoid direct blowing cold or muscle pain. Due to the large size, the AC unit will be shipped in 2 separate boxes and the delivery time may vary per box. Installation and use problems can be contacted at any time. ❄️NOTE: 5-YEAR Warranty for compressor / 5-YEAR Warranty for parts. Installation and use problems can be contacted at any time. We recommend that you ask a professional air conditioning installation workers to install.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oF-62-QtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SIMOE","source_asin":"B0BCKJ54NL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-652742","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCKJ54NL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCKJ54NL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
