window.products.push({"id":652931,"name":"Anidaroel Gaming Chair Mat for Hardwood Floors, 47 Inch Octagon Floor Protector Rugs, Computer Desk Chair Mat for Gaming Room Home Office","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Q0diPCWML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Easy to Clean】If the surface of the chair mat is dirty, you can use the vacuum cleaner directly to clean. When not in use, it can be easily folded and stored. (notice: It is folded in the package for delivery. There may be slight creases when first used. Ironing at low temperature will make the mat to remove creases faster, or press it for a while with a heavy object and it will recover flat completely.) 【Chair Mat Suitable for Gamer 】 47 x 47 inches, Octagon. It is made of polyester with durable, tough design. The surface texture is soft fabric just like low-pile carpet, it is very comfortable to step on it with bare feet when you playing game, which makes your gaming experience more perfect. 【Anti-Slip & Reduce Noise】The textured surface of the floor mat is designed to allow your chair casters to move easily when carrying out daily tasks, and its anti-slip backing design is to has enough grip to maintain a controlled roll. It also help reducing the noise of rolling chair, even playing games or working at night will not affect the others. 【No indents & No curls】The surface resilience of office chair mat is highly resilient, its edge of the chair mat uses a edge wrapping design, so there will be no curling at the edges, and easy to lay flat, you don't need to spend a lot of effort in straightening them. 【Effective Hard Floor Protector】 Anidaroel floor mat is designed for home office and gaming chair, it can protect your hardwood floor against harsh scuffs and scratches that chair wheels can cause. And it’s suitable for hardwood floors, tile, laminate linoleum floors, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Q0diPCWML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anidaroel","source_asin":"B09WMYPM19","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-652931","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WMYPM19","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WMYPM19","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
