window.products.push({"id":652978,"name":"Unna Margarita Salt Rimmer Set - Large Acacia Bar Salt and Sugar Rimmer, Fits up to 5.5in Glasses, Citrus Reamer, Stainless Steel Cocktail Jigger, 2 C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.83,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Yz18J9zpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ELEVATE YOUR BARTENDING GAME - Adding a rim is an easy way to level up your cocktail drinks. This margarita salt rimmer holds your rim mix neatly in place so you get an even coat and look like a pro. Run lime across the rim of your margarita glasses, then twist them in the salt mix. Use with bloody Mary glasses, gin and tonic glasses, martini glasses, mezcal copitas or any other cocktail or shot glasses. A CITRUS REAMER TO JUICE WITH EASE – This beechwood reamer’s pointed tip and deep ridges makes for efficient juicing. Just cut your lime or lemon in half and grab the beechwood lime juicer and get to work. PERFECTLY BALANCED COCKTAILS - Our stainless steel double-sided jigger accurately measures 1oz and 2oz pours. Don’t eyeball it, get it right! The included 4-inch cork coasters will look classy under any cocktail glasses. Great additions to your bar cart accessories. 4 UNIQUE COCKTAIL RIMMER RECIPES – Want to make it interesting? We have created and tested many rim recipes and are sharing our favourites with you. This complete cocktail set comes with 4 unique rim ideas. You’ll surely impress your guests at your next party. A THOUGHTFUL GIFT TO GIVE – This margarita gift set makes a perfect Housewarming gift, cinco de mayo gift, hosting gift, wedding gift, Christmas gift, party gift, bartender gift, or a bar gift for a cocktail lover. We know you’ll be thrilled with the quality of this tasting kit. If for any reason you aren’t satisfied, please reach out to us. You can trust that we’ll make it right for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Yz18J9zpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UNNA","source_asin":"B0BF915S9Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-652978","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF915S9Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF915S9Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
